      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "URBAN VIVI (1) was crowded for room and fell this course and distance last time. Rates on top in this line up and given another chance. LOVE OVER GOLD (2) was below best at her last couple, the latest finishing fifth at this track, but was among the placings at this track three back. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. SPRING DAZZLER (8) filled the minor placings again last time when third (23.29) at this track, making it five straight minors on end. Solid record at the distance winning two races. Has a good overall strike-rate and can find the frame here. SPRING CRUISER (4) is a last start winner who can measure up again.",
